text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'As long as you have more cards in hand than each opponent, Okina Nightwatch gets +3/+3.', "Enchant Mountain\\n{2}: Enchanted Mountain becomes a 6/1 red Spirit creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\\nWhen enchanted Mountain is put into a graveyard, you may return Genju of the Spires from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Flying, haste']
flavor: ['"I do not know which gives me more pride: the legions of soldiers marching in thunderous lockstep, or the cry of the skyknights riding their rocs like jagged lightning overhead."\\n—Razia', 'Only the most skilled budoka could protect the Okina Shrine. Only the best of these protectors took the night watch.']
